<title>FRANCE: UIC share suspended limit down.</title>
<headline>UIC share suspended limit down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in French property financing group UIC, which is controlled by state insurer GAN, were suspended limit down when the French stock exchange opened on Thursday, the French stock markets association said.</p>
<p>The share had been suspended for the entire day at 45 francs on Wednesday after falling 10.30 francs or 18.6 percent.</p>
<p>UIC said the preceding day its share was considerably overvalued on the basis of its negative net asset value.</p>
</text>
